        "description": "Stratix is a modern and minimalist WordPress theme built for professionals and creatives who seek clarity, style, and flexibility. Whether you're creating a personal portfolio, a business site, or an agency showcase, Stratix adapts seamlessly to your needs. Its clean design and intuitive features offer a smooth experience for both creators and visitors. With full WooCommerce support, you can also launch elegant online stores with ease."
